OL,3,AIran must stop arming Houthis in Yemen,
OL,4,AG7 says ahead of UN General Assembly
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran must "end its arming of and
OL,7,Fsupport" for the Houthis in Yemen, the
OL,8,Fforeign ministers of G7 nations have
OL,9,Fsaid in a joint statement.
OL,11,FThe G7 also condemned "in the strongest
OL,12,Fterms" Houthi attacks on Saudi Arabia,
OL,13,Fadding that the recent escalation in
OL,14,Ffighting against Saudi-backed forces in
OL,15,FYemen represented a threat to regional
OL,16,Fand global energy security.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
